<title>AUSTRALIA: Australia's SFE wheat futures mixed in light trade.</title>
<headline>Australia's SFE wheat futures mixed in light trade.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-06-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sydney Futures Exchange (SFE) wheat futures showed little movement on Friday, with only the January and March contracts traded.</p>
<p>January wheat fell 50 cents a tonne to $168.50 on volume of seven lots.</p>
<p>March wheat gained 50 cents to settle at A$171 a tonne on volume of three trades.</p>
